# 统一换行符：仓库与工作区一律使用 LF。
# 显式声明 `eol=lf` 后会覆盖 core.autocrlf，避免 Windows 上出现
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告以及跨平台协作时的整文件 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本必须保留 CRLF
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：不做换行转换，不参与文本 diff
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.gif     binary
*.webp    binary
*.ico     binary
*.ttf     binary
*.otf     binary
*.woff    binary
*.woff2   binary
*.jar     binary
*.zip     binary
*.gz      binary
*.so      binary
*.dylib   binary
*.dll     binary
*.a       binary
*.jks     binary
*.keystore binary
